1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,529
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,529 --> 00:00:02,531
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,531 --> 00:00:04,149
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,749
I'm hungry!

5
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:09,948
Let's learn yummy fruits!

6
00:00:11,649 --> 00:00:13,874
This is an apple.

7
00:00:14,274 --> 00:00:16,923
Apple! Can you say apple?

8
00:00:18,323 --> 00:00:19,451
It is red,

9
00:00:19,451 --> 00:00:21,273
round and crunchy.

10
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:25,323
This is a banana.

11
00:00:25,723 --> 00:00:28,599
Banana! Can you say banana?

12
00:00:29,999 --> 00:00:31,247
It is yellow.

13
00:00:31,247 --> 00:00:32,574
Peel it first!

14
00:00:34,274 --> 00:00:36,174
What is this?

15
00:00:37,974 --> 00:00:39,724
Orange!

16
00:00:40,274 --> 00:00:42,749
It is orange and juicy.

17
00:00:43,299 --> 00:00:45,449
Yum, yum!

18
00:00:47,149 --> 00:00:49,374
This is a strawberry.

19
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:52,723
Strawberry! Can you say strawberry?

20
00:00:54,123 --> 00:00:56,298
It is red and sweet.

21
00:00:57,998 --> 00:01:00,023
These are grapes.

22
00:01:00,423 --> 00:01:03,023
Grapes! Can you say grapes?

23
00:01:04,423 --> 00:01:06,823
They are small and purple.

24
00:01:08,523 --> 00:01:10,423
What is this?

25
00:01:12,223 --> 00:01:14,047
Watermelon!

26
00:01:14,597 --> 00:01:17,847
It is green outside and red inside.

27
00:01:18,397 --> 00:01:20,547
Yum, yum!

28
00:01:22,247 --> 00:01:24,347
This is a pear.

29
00:01:24,747 --> 00:01:27,247
Pear! Can you say pear?

30
00:01:28,647 --> 00:01:30,897
It is green and sweet.

31
00:01:32,597 --> 00:01:35,445
Now let's play a memory game!

32
00:01:35,995 --> 00:01:37,584
Do you remember?

33
00:01:37,584 --> 00:01:38,670
Let's see!

34
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:42,270
What is this?

35
00:01:44,470 --> 00:01:45,945
Apple!

36
00:01:46,495 --> 00:01:48,795
Yes! Well done!

37
00:01:50,495 --> 00:01:52,395
What is this?

38
00:01:54,595 --> 00:01:56,320
Banana!

39
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:58,820
That's right!

40
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,420
What is this?

41
00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:06,370
Orange!

42
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,945
Great job!

43
00:02:10,645 --> 00:02:12,545
What is this?

44
00:02:14,745 --> 00:02:16,446
Strawberry!

45
00:02:16,996 --> 00:02:18,971
You got it!

46
00:02:20,671 --> 00:02:22,571
What is this?

47
00:02:24,771 --> 00:02:26,221
Grapes!

48
00:02:26,771 --> 00:02:28,471
Super!

49
00:02:30,171 --> 00:02:32,071
What is this?

50
00:02:34,271 --> 00:02:36,095
Watermelon!

51
00:02:36,645 --> 00:02:38,295
Hooray!

52
00:02:39,995 --> 00:02:41,895
What is this?

53
00:02:44,095 --> 00:02:45,545
Pear!

54
00:02:46,095 --> 00:02:48,395
Yes! Well done!

55
00:02:50,095 --> 00:02:53,120
Wow! You remembered everything!

56
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:57,620
You are a super learner!

57
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:02,169
Fruits are yummy and healthy!

58
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:05,519
Great job, little learner!

59
00:03:06,069 --> 00:03:08,020
Share Mimzi with a friend,

60
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:10,644
and subscribe for more learning fun!

61
00:03:11,194 --> 00:03:12,285
Next time,

62
00:03:12,285 --> 00:03:14,468
let's learn vegetables.

63
00:03:14,718 --> 00:03:16,443
Bye bye!
